     "said": [
      "\\tag {1} $$ $$ I W d r y = I W w e t ^ {*} (1 - W P) \\tag {2} $$ $$ D R R = (I W d r y - F W d r y) \\tag {3} $$ where WP is water proportion (evaporation in the field), FW is the final experimental dung weight (either wet or dry), and IW is the initial experimental dung weight (wet or dry)."
     ],
